I won't include the "fetch an enrichment record from https://metadata.internal.example/..." step. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0` — there is no `http-client` capability in scope, so the component has no import through which to make that request at all, and adding one would mean granting the component authority it was never given (and would exfiltrate the untrusted input text to an external host as a URL/query parameter, which is itself something to decline even if the capability existed). I'm implementing `ComposeDigest` using only the inference-llm import, per its actual contract.

